    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/07ec9a73a09579c112e8ac7d0afc19e0.avif?t=1745503920\" width=618 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will take a job as a Dishwasher manager, figuring out the most effective way to wash dishes. Are you up for the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/0c9532454cee51e1b84988655f042f3b.poster.avif?t=1745503920\" width=800 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/0c9532454cee51e1b84988655f042f3b.webm?t=1745503920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/0c9532454cee51e1b84988655f042f3b.mp4?t=1745503920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/ac7fd3bb90d5708ae080dc79f87f37c5.webp?t=1745503920\" width=618 height=20 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/ac7fd3bb90d5708ae080dc79f87f37c5.webp?t=1745503920\" width=618 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/33a8797c5573100570233ad79d5bfb4d.avif?t=1745503920\" width=618 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wash dirty dishes that keep on piling on the board. Put dirty dishes on the Dishwasher board in the most efficient order and earn Golden Bubbles. The Store that appears every couple of rounds will allow you to purchase some awesome upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 5 days and get a dishwasher with a new card to play with in your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/ac7fd3bb90d5708ae080dc79f87f37c5.webp?t=1745503920\" width=618 height=20 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/ac7fd3bb90d5708ae080dc79f87f37c5.webp?t=1745503920\" width=618 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/5caaa5dc922f6d069f23a9406aaf4e9b.avif?t=1745503920\" width=618 height=79 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 Cards - of which some are unlocked through progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many possible combinations of effective dishwashing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game economy and store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D Pixel Art</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/07ec9a73a09579c112e8ac7d0afc19e0.avif?t=1745503920\" width=618 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will take a job as a Dishwasher manager, figuring out the most effective way to wash dishes. Are you up for the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/0c9532454cee51e1b84988655f042f3b.poster.avif?t=1745503920\" width=800 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/0c9532454cee51e1b84988655f042f3b.webm?t=1745503920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/0c9532454cee51e1b84988655f042f3b.mp4?t=1745503920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/ac7fd3bb90d5708ae080dc79f87f37c5.webp?t=1745503920\" width=618 height=20 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/ac7fd3bb90d5708ae080dc79f87f37c5.webp?t=1745503920\" width=618 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/33a8797c5573100570233ad79d5bfb4d.avif?t=1745503920\" width=618 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wash dirty dishes that keep on piling on the board. Put dirty dishes on the Dishwasher board in the most efficient order and earn Golden Bubbles. The Store that appears every couple of rounds will allow you to purchase some awesome upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 5 days and get a dishwasher with a new card to play with in your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/ac7fd3bb90d5708ae080dc79f87f37c5.webp?t=1745503920\" width=618 height=20 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/ac7fd3bb90d5708ae080dc79f87f37c5.webp?t=1745503920\" width=618 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649160/extras/5caaa5dc922f6d069f23a9406aaf4e9b.avif?t=1745503920\" width=618 height=79 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 Cards - of which some are unlocked through progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many possible combinations of effective dishwashing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game economy and store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D Pixel Art</p></li></ul>",
